title: Basic Services

files:
  - em.prog:em.examples.basic/Ex02_BlinkerP.em.ts
  - nordic.nrf52:nordic.distro.nrf52/BoardC.em.ts

steps:
  - cmds:
      - open 1
    text: |
      {[ht,$start]&thinsp;Back to Basics}

      We return to {[cu]BlinkerP} &ndash; to now see how {[cu]BoardC} bridges portable **EMS** code with a distro's HW-specific content.

      We've already visited {[cu]BoardC} &ndash; in a **Language Overview** {[tr,100/03/09]} as well as when touring **Basic Examples** {[tr,101/01/05]}.

      The next tours in this group approach {[cu]BoardC} differently, layering functionality to support more complex examples:

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]}&nbsp; **Basic Services** &mdash; {[cu]DebugP}, {[cu]FiberP}, {[cu]HelloP}<br>
      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]}&nbsp; **Timers&thinsp;+&thinsp;Interrupts** &mdash; {[cu]OneShot[1-3]P}<br>
      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]}&nbsp; **Sleep&thinsp;+&thinsp;Wakeup** &mdash; {[cu]Alarm[1-2]P}, {[cu]TickerP}<br>
      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]}&nbsp; **Edge Interrupts** &mdash; {[cu]Button[1-3]P}<br>

      <div class="em-info">

      Support for **CoreMark** [&thinsp;{[tr,102/01/01]}, {[tr,102/07/03]}&thinsp;] will also fall into place as we incrementally expand {[cu]BoardC}.

      </div>

  - cmds:
      - open 2
      - fold 2 3 4
      - fold 2 6 8
      - fold 2 6 8
      - fold 2 12 14
      - fold 2 15 16
      - fold 2 18 26
      - fold 2 54 1000
      - mark 2 A 5
      - mark 2 B 28
      - mark 2 C 41
    focus: [2, 1]
    text: |
      {[ht,$extra]&thinsp;%[cu]BoardC% &ndash; Import&thinsp;&middot;&thinsp;Export}

  - cmds:
      - open 2
      - fold 2 3 4
      - fold 2 6 8
      - fold 2 6 8
      - fold 2 12 14
      - fold 2 15 16
      - fold 2 18 26
      - fold 2 59 63
      - fold 2 71 73
      - fold 2 74 76
      - fold 2 85 86
      - fold 2 89 91
      - mark 2 A 5
      - mark 2 B 28
      - mark 2 C 41
      - mark 2 D 55
    focus: [2, 60]
    text: |
      {[ht,$extra]&thinsp;%[cu]BoardC% &ndash; Configuration}

  - text: |
      {[ht,$extra]&thinsp;Extra Credit}

  - text: |
      {[ht,$steps]&thinsp;Next Steps}
